WEBVTT

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.120
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.050
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.930
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.070
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
<i>No dodge</i>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.510
<i>No surrender</i>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.060
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.990
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:32.350
<b>Episode Two
The Last Summoner, Season 1, Part 1</b>

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:35.370
Pass!

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:37.080
Over here!

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:39.120
Pass here!

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:40.220
This way!

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:41.660
Block him!

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:49.720
Hey, you're dressed a bit flashy 
right now, don't you think?

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:51.720
Don't worry.

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:55.400
I may be a real hottie, but normal 
folks can't see us spirits.

00:01:58.420 --> 00:01:59.790
<i>Breaking news.</i>

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:02.470
<i>A man was spotted flying in 
the city's skies last night.</i>

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:04.640
FOOTAGE FROM CTVV

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.650
<i>Many witnesses took photos of the incident.</i>

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:09.130
<i>In other news,</i>

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:11.930
<i>a large tree was uprooted in the 
city center park last night.</i>

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:14.230
<i>Fortunately, no one in the vicinity was hurt.</i>

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:17.050
<i>Next up is entertainment news...</i>

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:19.450
Gotta keep a low profile. Low profile...

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.350
No more messing up!

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:24.600
I told you, don't worry.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:25.830
Come.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.520
Help me put on some sunscreen.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.810
My leg is getting really sore.

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:36.030
This is all your fault for 
not giving me a massage.

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:40.470
A mosquito?

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:45.060
What in the world is this?

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:49.140
A carnivorous plant!

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:52.740
Ah Jie!

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:55.150
Help me!

00:02:57.180 --> 00:02:58.660
You idiot!

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.810
That's enough with you!

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:03.890
Ah...

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:04.900
Jie!

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:13.180
Ah Jie!

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:24.890
Stop right there!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.020
What the hell is this?

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.520
It's getting out of hand!

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:36.890
Get me out!

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:38.470
You idiot!

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:39.770
Aren't you really powerful?

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:41.840
You summoned a big claw, 
and you flew into the sky!

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.720
Why don't you get out by yourself?!

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:47.000
I can't do anything if I get
 too far away from you!

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.020
What does that mean?

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.560
Explain!

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:54.310
Summoned spirits can only use their powers 
when they're with their Summoners!

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.720
Why would I keep shamelessly 
pestering you otherwise?

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.820
Why didn't you tell me something 
so important sooner?!

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:01.560
Almost there!

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.280
Fool!

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:18.060
<b>Wind Forest High School Club Recruitment Festival</b>

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:19.910
Excuse me.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:21.190
Sorry 'bout that.

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:25.640
Crap, there are club activities going on.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.340
How am I supposed to find her?

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.970
You bastard!

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:36.510
Aren't you the one who turned my 
sister down when she asked you out?!

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:42.130
Do you know how hurt she is 
because of your rude behavior?!

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:49.140
That girl, huh?

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:52.020
Now, Sis, show everyone your determination.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.140
Is this some kind of performance?

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:00.380
She's like a female Tarzan!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:04.140
Hey, Ah Jie!

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.000
It's so dark and damp in here!

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.770
Where are you?!

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:10.760
Hurry up already!

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:12.260
Here's another chance.

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:13.040
Okay.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.160
Accept my sister's love,

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.020
and join us, the martial arts club!

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:22.210
You two will wander this world together 
as a heroic couple, smiling proud!

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.210
Okay, all right.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.020
I got it!

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:25.990
Good, at least you got some tact!

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:34.540
Don't cry, Sis. Don't cry! You bastard!

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:35.770
Dora, can you hear me?

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.760
Hello... Hello?

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:39.390
Why are you getting quieter?

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:40.130
Hey!

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.040
The farther away summoned spirits 
get from their Summoner,

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.260
the less power they have.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:47.830
If you don't hurry up,

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:53.220
the telepathic link between us will be lost.

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:54.630
I'll think of something.

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:55.640
Hey!

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:58.020
I know what you're looking for.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:00.930
I know the answer, too.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:06.120
I even know that you're no normal guy.

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:11.520
I see that you possess a special ability.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:14.060
You're not alone!

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:17.330
Come join us, the Supernatural 
Human Research Society!

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:19.210
Here, you'll be with your own kind!

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:24.100
Let us defend the galaxy together!

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:33.850
Sorry, I'm in a rush.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:38.140
Damn it! One of these days, 
you're gonna come beg me!

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.350
Got you at last!

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:46.180
Ow! That hurts!

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:47.020
Get off already!

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:47.790
You perv!

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:49.280
What are you doing?!

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:51.190
My bad...

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.260
Ah Jie...

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:57.390
I can't hold on for much longer.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.160
It's way too loud over there!

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:00.250
I can't hear you!

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.970
Y-You asshole!

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:02.860
Quiet down!

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.200
That sound...

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:10.420
All right, I know where you are!

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:16.060
There's only one band in the whole 
world capable of making music this crappy!

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:25.880
I knew it.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:26.970
It's right here!

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.570
Dora!

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:31.280
Hey! Dora, where are you?

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:41.340
Dora, can you hear me?

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.010
Feels like you got a little closer.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:46.890
You're getting closer.

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:48.560
But I'm feeling dizzy.

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:51.040
I'm falling asleep...

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:52.060
Crap...

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:54.320
Hey, hey!

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:56.280
It's too early for bed.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.040
Listen to me.

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:01.280
I just realized something.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:05.710
The other day, I was trying 
to get rid of you to no avail.

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:07.720
Now that I think about it,

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:10.460
if I let the plant take you,

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.980
I'll be completely rid of you.

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:15.310
Is he ill?

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:20.220
Ah Jie, you heartless idiot!

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:21.370
I'll tear your guts out!

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:22.190
I'll rip you apart!

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:25.310
Screw you!

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:27.240
Come closer!

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:31.100
Just a bit closer, and I won't
 need your help anymore!

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:38.100
Close enough yet?

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.770
You goddamned imbecile of a plant!

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.970
You dare to cross me, huh?!

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:57.310
You're gonna pay for this!

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:03.800
It got away!

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:06.110
It knows how to burrow into the ground?!

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:06.890
Calm down.

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:10.720
I found its master.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:35.300
So cocky!

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.850
Come fight me if you think you're all that!

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:44.020
You cheeky little...

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:45.720
Come!

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:49.460
I'll make a salad out of you!

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:15.280
All right, cut it out.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:16.400
There's too many people here.

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:17.420
Let's not make trouble.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:20.560
I'm so mad!

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:23.650
That pisses me off so much!

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:24.640
Calm down.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.590
There's no need for all that violence.

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.070
What's more,

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:34.720
we can't take this girl on.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.350
Right, Ah Jie.

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:42.100
How did you find out she's the Summoner?

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:43.940
Oh, that?

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:45.840
It wasn't actually that 
hard to figure it out.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.360
Normal people can't see spirits,

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:51.190
so anyone who could've ambushed 
you must also be a Summoner.

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:55.040
None of the passers-by could see the flower,

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.770
so that was obviously a spirit.

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.590
So, that begs the question:

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:02.100
Where is its Summoner?

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.520
Spirits can't stray too 
far from their Summoners.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.260
Otherwise, they're incapacitated.

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:11.340
Which means its master was nearby.

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:15.640
I just had to pay attention 
to where the flower was going.

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:17.180
It was practically running in a circle.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:21.150
That means the Summoner must've 
been at the center of the circle.

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:24.390
Whoa, nice detective work.

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:29.260
That Summoner girl's outfit 
is made of top-grade material.

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:30.610
Her family's probably rich.

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:32.270
That's not the point, though.

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:36.140
If you took a closer look at her earring,
 there was a black rose symbol.

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:38.880
It actually looks pretty similar 
to our school's emblem.

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:42.270
That's a huge aristocratic family's crest.

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:46.720
Even our school is run 
by that highbred family.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.060
We can't afford to cross them.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.150
What's more,

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:53.080
even though the Summoner was so far away,

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.810
the spirit was still so powerful.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.970
I shudder to imagine how 
powerful she truly is.

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:00.670
That's amazing!

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:02.620
You're such an amazing detective, Ah Jie!

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:04.920
Just messing with you, dummy.

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:06.060
There's no detective work here.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:09.700
She stood out from the crowd, 
and I spotted her right away.

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:14.630
Damn it!

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:16.060
I almost believed you!

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:22.100
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:22.100
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:22.100
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:22.100
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:22.100
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:22.100
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:28.430
You slipped up.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.600
Very interesting.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:36.810
Sorry, Master.

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:39.100
I underestimated our enemy.

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:44.040
I was afraid things would get out 
of hand with all the people there.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:44.040
What is there to worry about?

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:45.900
If anything gets out of hand, I'm here.

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:50.810
Don't hold back. Whatever it takes, do it.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:53.850
I want to see their full potential.

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:55.380
Yeah.

00:12:57.390 --> 00:12:58.780
Got it, Master!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.460
Hey, wait for me, Missy!

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:06.470
Ah Jie,

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:09.680
I look forward to even 
more surprises from you.

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:18.980
My goddess!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.310
She's so beautiful!

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:25.750
What a hottie!

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:28.720
Hey, come check this out!

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:30.620
Let's go!

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.890
After all that running, I'm beat.

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:03.720
What was that about?

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:07.180
Let's see what we got here.

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:08.140
What does it say?

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:11.060
"I'll wait for you in 
the woods after school"!

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:12.710
The words of the goddess!

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:15.920
Handwritten by the goddess herself!

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:17.000
You see?

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.550
There's no judging a man by his looks!

00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:19.890
Nicely done!

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:24.850
Now that's what I'm talking about, dude!

00:14:24.850 --> 00:14:26.280
Is he really seeing the goddess?

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:27.060
I heard she asked him out!

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:27.790
I'm so jealous!

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:28.910
That's so amazing!

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:30.180
I can't believe it!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.430
You busybodies...

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:34.850
You bastard!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.550
Not only did you turn down my little sister,

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:38.180
you also stole my goddess from me!

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:39.580
Damn it!

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:41.660
I'm going to kill you!

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:43.510
Let go of me!

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:46.260
Ah Jie, you're famous now!

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:03.920
<i>When will they stop tailing me?</i>

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:06.840
Miaowu.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:09.170
You tagged along, huh?

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:13.000
You sneak around like a ghost, y'know?

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:14.140
Watch your injuries.

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:21.300
Looks like she's fine.

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:27.570
I'm so jealous!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:28.250
Yeah.

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.980
When'll it be my turn to get that lucky?

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:33.720
What's this?

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:34.830
What is this stuff?

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.580
I got tangled up!

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:39.210
What the hell?!

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:46.610
Weird.

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:48.220
There's no way forward.

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:51.940
Ah Jie, look!

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:01.100
Is it opening a path for us?

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:30.930
You two came.

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:33.220
You again!

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:35.920
Ah Jie, this is your last chance.

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:38.720
If you don't want to die, 
hand over that spirit!

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:40.500
And then scram!

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.270
How cocky!

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:45.700
Sorry, I've got no idea who you people are.

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:46.890
Definitely don't care, either.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.100
Now, this little runt?

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:51.020
She's my family's new pet.

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:53.450
She's got a bad temper, 
and eats way too much,

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.430
but we've spent time together, 
so I'm pretty attached to her.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:58.370
It's my responsibility as 
her master to protect her.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:16:59.560
Hope you guys don't mind.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.090
Scared, huh?

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:20.350
Well, too late!

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:30.250
Damn it! They had a secret weapon!

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:33.020
Just you wait! I'll find something!

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:36.150
Dora! Think of something!

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:37.430
What are you doing?!

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:40.470
Where did I put my cleavers now?

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:44.000
Ah Jie, you keep pulling aggro there.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.220
I'll be there soon! Hang in there!

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:46.250
You're kidding!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.900
How do I hold out against this?!

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:15.920
Dora, are you done yet?!

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:18.750
There's no counting on you, is there?!

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:20.300
Weird... Where are my cleavers?

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.720
Ah Jie, hang in there! 
I'll come help you soon!

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:23.830
We put some distance between them.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.800
Missy, let's get this over with!

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:28.390
We can do this with just 
30 percent of our strength!

00:18:29.110 --> 00:18:31.020
By the name of the Black Rose...

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:55.580
Where are they?

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:08.120
Whoa, a big tree!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.180
We're in big trouble!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.810
Can't catch me!

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:21.220
Crap!

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:22.640
Dora, watch out!

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:24.600
Let go of me!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:26.150
Help me!

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:28.050
Ah Jie!

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:54.850
That idiot got himself killed too!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:12.640
What? A knife?!

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:16.460
This is a super-sharp antique cleaver!

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:19.430
My blue, epic, treasured weapon!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:26.640
Missy, no more holding back!

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:27.700
Yeah.

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:33.140
Dora! Use that move!

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:35.220
Got it!

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:56.320
Crystal Wings!

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:07.720
An opening!

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:09.010
Ah Jie, go!

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:23.720
Come! Get a taste of this!

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:32.850
Last one!

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:44.890
What?!

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:57.100
Ah Jie!

00:21:57.970 --> 00:21:59.910
Ah Jie, that's so cool!

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:03.990
I didn't know you knew martial arts!

00:22:03.990 --> 00:22:06.310
Martial arts? I only know how to cook.

00:22:06.310 --> 00:22:09.690
I just went with the flow and chopped 
away like it's a kitchen knife.

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:11.950
That's all I did.

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:37.180
You're wide open!

00:22:39.430 --> 00:22:43.830
Watch this! Here's my final attack!

00:22:55.140 --> 00:23:01.630
<i>Sit with you watching the night sky</i>

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:06.870
<i>Vast stars reflect in our eyes</i>

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:14.460
<i>Like thousands of tiny wishes in our hearts</i>

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:19.980
<i>Longing to discover the origin of the 
mysterious everlasting ancient world</i>

00:23:19.980 --> 00:23:24.970
<i>The past and the present are 
linked in a fantastic instant</i>

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:29.970
<i>Watch over our beautiful 
home against evil forever</i>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:34.960
<i>The blazing sun is our inevitable 
cruel test of growth</i>

00:23:34.960 --> 00:23:40.010
<i>May we return from thorny 
paths still being young</i>

00:23:40.010 --> 00:23:45.010
<i>With love and hate, laughter and 
tears, compose every touching moment</i>

00:23:45.010 --> 00:23:49.970
<i>Five friends shoulder to shoulder, 
friendship will last until eternity</i>

00:23:49.970 --> 00:23:57.420
<i>With you tomorrow must 
be full of shining hopes</i>

00:23:57.420 --> 00:24:02.570
<i>Our tomorrow</i>
